{"translation":{"id":"gaz_ebi","name":"ክታበ ቁልቁሉ, Biblica® ሂካ አመያ በነማ ሃራ, ሎቆደ ዽኣ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"EBI","englishName":"West Central Oromo Bible","language":"gaz","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"f3eeb22163e62abd4aeeda7f1c58a68dfa1fff2482db437ee160fb95280d59e5","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"Oromoo","languageEnglishName":"Oromo"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"gaz_ebi","name":"ሆሴኣ","commonName":"ሆሴኣ","title":"ራጂ ሆሴኣ","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"72244536d9404b992eb62b15971a2e27bbd0b4642b4487007f0eedf6754ab5ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ኤበ አርገቹዻፍ ቀልቢ ጅጂረቹ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ያ እስራኤል፣ ገረ ዋቀዮ ዋቀኬቲት ዴብእ።","poem":1},{"text":"አት ሰበቢ ጩቡኬቲቲፍ ጉፈቴቲ!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ዱብቸ ፉዸዹቲ","poem":1},{"text":"ገረ ዋቀዮ ዴብእ።","poem":2},{"text":"አከነስ ጄዺን፦","poem":1},{"text":"“ጩቡኬኘ ሁንደ ኑፍ ዺስ፤","poem":2},{"text":"አከ ኑ እጀ አረበኬኛ ሲፍ ዽኤስኑፍ፣","poem":1},{"text":"አርጁማዻን ኑ ስመዹ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"አሶር ኑ ኦልቹ ህንደንደኡ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ኑ ፈርዴን ሎላ ህንያበትኑ።","poem":2},{"text":"ኑ ስአች ዴብኔ፣ ዋን ሀርክኬኘ ሆጄቴን፣","poem":1},{"text":"‘ዋቆተኬኘ’ ህንጄኑ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዳእመን አባ ህንቀብኔ ገረ ላፍነ ስራ አርገቱቲ።”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“አን ገንቱማሳኒ ነንፈይሰ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ቶሉመን እሳን ጃለዸ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ኣሪንኮ እሳንራ ዴብኤራቲ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"አን እስራኤልት አኩመ ፍጤንሳ ነንተአ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እን አኩመ ደራራ ንደራረ።","poem":2},{"text":"እን አኩመ ጋትራ ልባኖን","poem":1},{"text":"ህደሳ ገድ ፈጌፈተ፤","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ደሜንሳ ንጉደተ።","poem":2},{"text":"ሚዸግንሳ አኩመ ሙከ ኤጄርሳ ተአ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ኡርጋንሳ አኩመ ጋትራ ልባኖን።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ነሞትን አመስ ዴብአኒ ጋድሰሳ ጀለ ጅራቱ።","poem":1},{"text":"እን አኩመ ምዻኒ ለልሰ።","poem":2},{"text":"አኩመ ሙከ ወይኒ ደጋገ፤","poem":1},{"text":"መቃንሳስ አኩመ ዳዺ ወይኒ ልባኖን ቤከመ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ያ ኤፍሬም፣ አን ከነ ጫላዋቆተ ቶልፈሞ ወጅን ዽመ ማሊን ቀበ?","poem":1},{"text":"ከን ዴቢ ሲፍ ኬኔ ስ ኤጉ አኑመ።","poem":2},{"text":"አን አኩመ ሙከ ብርብርሰ ለልሳት፤","poem":1},{"text":"አመነሙማንኬ አነራ ዹፈ።”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ነምን ኦጌስ ኤኙ? እን ዋን ከነ ንቤከ።","poem":1},{"text":"ቀልቢ ቀቤስ ኤኙ? እን ዋን ከነ ንሁበተ።","poem":2},{"text":"ከራን ዋቀዮ ቀጄላዸ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ነምን ቀጄላን እሰረ ዴመ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ፍንጭልቶትን ገሩ እሰረት ጉፈቱ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}